OL,3,GNEWSA'My rent was higher than my
OL,4,Astudent loan' - the booming cost of
OL,5,Aprivate halls
OL,6,
OL,7,FYou don't have to walk far in any
OL,8,Funiversity city before spotting some
OL,9,Fform of private Purpose-Built Student
OL,10,FAccommodation (PBSA).
OL,12,FThese large blocks of student housing
OL,13,Fare springing up in cities across the
OL,14,FUK, yet rents continue to soar and
OL,15,Fyoung people studying at university say
OL,16,Fthey're still finding it difficult to
OL,17,Fsecure a place to live.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
