OL,3,GNEWSA'My rent was higher than my
OL,4,Astudent loan' - the booming cost of
OL,5,Aprivate halls
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe increase in PBSA has predominantly
OL,8,Fbeen driven by private companies, with
OL,9,Fmany developments targeting more
OL,10,Faffluent international and postgraduate
OL,11,Fstudents, who industry experts say are
OL,12,Fbecoming increasingly important to the
OL,13,Fsector.
OL,15,FDevelopers say they are meeting a
OL,16,Fmarket demand but campaigners argue
OL,17,Fthat they are too expensive for most
OL,18,FScottish students and more affordable
OL,19,Fhousing should be being built instead.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
